        "affiliation": "Sony Corporation of America",
        "bio": "P. Dare received his technical education at the Royal Melbourne Institute of Technology graduating in 1958. He attended the University of Pennsylvania Wharton School and received his Master's of Business Administration degree in 1972. Prior to joining Sony in 1981, he was employed by RCA Corporation for 15 years holding various engineering and product management positions. He is currently Vice President of Product Operations for Sony Broadcast Products in the United States.",
