      {
        "affiliation": "Sony Corporation of Japan",
        "bio": "Kazuo Ike received a B.S. degree in 1968, an M.S. degree in 1970 in Mechanical Engineering from the Keio-Gijuku University. He joined Sony in 1970 and was involved in the development of the process technology for magnetic tape manufacturing until 1972. Since 1973 he has been engaged in the development and design of the various VTRs which include BVH-2000 Series Type “C 1” VTRS. He is principal mechanical engineering manager in the Video Products Division.",
        "name": "K. Ike"
